      "id": 2335,
      "category": "team",
      "content": "Researcher @ahsantahir reported a content spoofing on the search functionality. The search query was displayed in the page, but without any prefix. We added \"Results for:\", so nobody can be misinformed.\n\nThis has been [fixed in the last version](https://github.com/gratipay/gratipay.com/commit/382483c727a6eca08ad9880c2583437139f01df3) and the fix is now deployed.\n\nThanks for making Gratipay a safer place!",
